        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy LTX-2.3- ID LoRA\n\nGenerate personalized videos with synchronized audio from a text prompt, reference image, and short audio clip. Use ID-LoRA to adapt a person's appearance and voice in a single generative model. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/video_ltx2_3_id_lora.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
